rors.\n10. Prefer safe Rust internally as long as semantics match.\n\n=========================  YOUR ASSIGNMENT  =========================\n\nTranslate SHA-256, SHA-512 and the crypto_hash front-end:\n\n  crypto_hash/sha256/hash_sha256.c        -> src/crypto_hash/sha256.rs\n  crypto_hash/sha256/cp/hash_sha256_cp.c  -> src/crypto_hash/sha256.rs (same file)\n  crypto_hash/sha512/hash_sha512.c        -> src/crypto_hash/sha512.rs\n  crypto_hash/sha512/cp/hash_sha512_cp.c  -> src/crypto_hash/sha512.rs (same file)\n  crypto_hash/crypto_hash.c               -> src/crypto_hash/mod.rs (APPEND below the\n      existing `pub mod sha256; pub mod sha3; pub mod sha512;` lines — KEEP THEM)\n\nHeaders to read: include/sodium/crypto_hash.h, crypto_hash_sha256.h,\ncrypto_hash_sha512.h, include/sodium/private/common.h\n\nEXACT exported symbols you must produce:\n\nsrc/crypto_hash/sha256.rs (6):\n  crypto_hash_sha256 crypto_hash_sha256_bytes crypto_hash_sha256_final\n  crypto_hash_sha256_init crypto_hash_sha256_statebytes crypto_hash_sha256_update\n\nsrc/crypto_hash/sha512.rs (6):\n  crypto_hash_sha512 crypto_hash_sha512_bytes crypto_hash_sha512_final\n  crypto_hash_sha512_init crypto_hash_sha512_statebytes crypto_hash_sha512_update\n\nsrc/crypto_hash/mod.rs (3):\n  crypto_hash crypto_hash_bytes crypto_hash_primitive\n\nNotes:\n - `hash_sha256_cp.c` / `hash_sha512_cp.c` contain the actual implementation\n   (be_*_encode/decode helpers, SHA256_Transform, etc.) and also define\n   `crypto_hash_sha256`/`_init`/`_update`/`_final`; `hash_sha256.c` only defines\n   `crypto_hash_sha256_bytes()` and `crypto_hash_sha256_statebytes()`.\n - crypto_hash_sha256_state = { uint32_t state[8]; uint64_t count; uint8_t buf[64]; }\n   crypto_hash_sha512_state = { uint64_t state[8]; uint64_t count[2]; uint8_t buf[128]; }\n   Verify against the headers; statebytes() must equal the C sizeof.\n - Watch the `SHA256_Pad`/`SHA512_Pad` bit-count arithmetic and the exact\n   `be32enc_vect`/`be64enc_vect` loop bounds.\n\nWhen done report: files written + line counts + the output of\n`nm -D --defined-only target/release/libsodium.so | grep -E 'crypto_hash' | sort`."}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":457,"cache_read_input_tokens":216612,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":457,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"548cc808-00d2-470c-b99f-a8d3e7e02fd0","uuid":"f948241f-c46d-41ef-90ab-5dcdc8d32fe4","timestamp":"2026-08-22T19:54:44.172Z"}
