{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_bdrk_5xr5tg74dwjuugwu2swr452s23p225ac6enkie6yqkulw6jptvsa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_bdrk_01N6PdM4Gz1PxRbW4Z5rDbXW","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/local/home/scheschb/.harvest/work/harvest-translate-9qBOQP/translated_rust/src/crypto_kem/xwing.rs","content":"//! Translation of `crypto_kem/xwing/kem_xwing.c`.\n\nuse core::ffi::{c_int, c_void};\n\nuse crate::common::memcpy;\nuse crate::crypto_kem::mlkem768::{\n    crypto_kem_mlkem768_CIPHERTEXTBYTES, crypto_kem_mlkem768_PUBLICKEYBYTES,\n    crypto_kem_mlkem768_SECRETKEYBYTES, crypto_kem_mlkem768_SEEDBYTES,\n    crypto_kem_mlkem768_SHAREDSECRETBYTES, crypto_kem_mlkem768_dec,\n    crypto_kem_mlkem768_enc_deterministic, crypto_kem_mlkem768_seed_keypair,\n};\nuse crate::randombytes::randombytes_buf;\nuse crate::sodium::utils::sodium_memzero;\n\n// include/sodium/crypto_kem_xwing.h\npub const crypto_kem_xwing_PUBLICKEYBYTES: usize = 1216;\npub const crypto_kem_xwing_SECRETKEYBYTES: usize = 32;\npub const crypto_kem_xwing_CIPHERTEXTBYTES: usize = 1120;\npub const crypto_kem_xwing_SHAREDSECRETBYTES: usize = 32;\npub const crypto_kem_xwing_SEEDBYTES: usize = 32;\n\n// include/sodium/crypto_scalarmult_curve25519.h\nconst crypto_scalarmult_curve25519_BYTES: usize = 32;\nconst crypto_scalarmult_curve25519_SCALARBYTES: usize = 32;\n\n/// ```c\n/// typedef struct CRYPTO_ALIGN(16) crypto_hash_sha3256_state {\n///     unsigned char opaque[256];\n/// } crypto_hash_sha3256_state;\n/// ```\n#[repr(C, align(16))]\nstruct crypto_hash_sha3256_state {\n    opaque: [u8; 256],\n}\n\nunsafe extern \"C\" {\n    fn crypto_hash_sha3256_init(state: *mut crypto_hash_sha3256_state) -> c_int;\n    fn crypto_hash_sha3256_update(\n        state: *mut crypto_hash_sha3256_state,\n        in_: *const u8,\n        inlen: u64,\n    ) -> c_int;\n    fn crypto_hash_sha3256_final(state: *mut crypto_hash_sha3256_state, out: *mut u8) -> c_i